UnitDefense.s:
Returns the defense of the unit without armor, and defense value of their armor.

For NPCs and pets, it will return a baseDefense value, though armorDefense will be 0. For other player targets than "player", it will return 0 for baseDefense and 0 for armorDefense.

baseDefense, armorDefense = UnitDefense(unit);
